credit, and the links to their projects, with it.

patches/0001-0024 are NFSU2Deadware's by LeoDeadware (https://github.com/LeoDeadware/NFSU2Deadware, MIT,
LICENSES/MIT-NFSU2Deadware.txt), without its HD texture and translation patches; the installer's kit builder, build and import
scripts adapt its tools (MIT). xboxrecomp by sp00nz is MIT (LICENSES/MIT-xboxrecomp.txt); its APU and NV2A parts from xemu are
LGPL-2.1-or-later (LICENSES/LGPL-2.1-xemu.txt, LICENSES/NOTICE-xboxrecomp.txt): the installer ships them as object files and
links them on the player's Mac, so they can be relinked with modified versions. Third-party libraries: THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

No game code or data is part of this project or its releases: the game is built on the player's Mac from their own disc.
